# GMS's "Arrows Fired: 3" is the ammo a swing uses (the client's bulletConsume),
# not a hit count.
name: "Arrow Blow"
description: "Shoot consecutive arrows at multiple enemies."
kind: SKILL_KIND_ATTACK
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_ARCHER skill_order: 1 }
max_level: 20
